Cheren: {VAR 0100 0000}!{VAR BE01}
Since we both hold the Jet Badge now,
let's see which of us is stronger!{VAR BE01}

Alder: That was a fine Pokémon battle!{VAR BE01}
I'm happy to see you are both growing
as Trainers!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: If it isn't the Champion, Alder.
I'm weak, so I lost!{VAR BE01}
...And, honestly, it bothers me when you
call it a fine battle despite that.{VAR BE01}

Alder: Oh, honestly, Cheren.{VAR BE01}
Just accept the compliment without the
stinging remark.{VAR BE01}
I've asked you this before, but what do
you plan to do after becoming strong?{VAR BE01}

Cheren: If I get strong and become a
Champion, that will be the reason for{VAR BE00}
my existence.{VAR BE00}
I want to prove that I'm really living.{VAR BE01}

Alder: Hmmm...
You remind me of Marshal.{VAR BE01}
Of course, having something you want
to become is important.{VAR BE01}
But what is even more important is
what you do with your newfound power.{VAR BE01}
Anyway, take this!{VAR BE01}

Alder: If you use the move Surf, you can
travel over water.{VAR BE01}
I shall see you again, young Trainers.{VAR BE01}
Don't forget about the needs of the
Pokémon at your side!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: What I do with my power...{VAR BE01}
I don't know that answer yet. First, I
want to become a strong Trainer so{VAR BE00}
everyone will acknowledge that power!{VAR BE01}

You are {VAR 0100 0000}, aren't you?{VAR BE01}
Are you surprised that I know?
Clay told me.{VAR BE01}
Uh-oh! To go inside Twist Mountain,
you need to have a Gym Badge from the{VAR BE00}
Mistralton Gym!{VAR BE01}
The wild Pokémon here are tougher, and
we want to be sure you're ready!
